{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "538d8a6558feb4da2934e08094b70daa8c4ceff2c3afd6f7989b3c8769eb94a8", "ja": "ん～……せっかく着替えたんだし、軽く読み合わせも\nしておこうかなぁ。役作りも進めておきたいし……。", "zh": "嗯……难得都换好衣服了，要不要也简单对一下台词呢。毕竟也想提前推进角色塑造……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d40f53e9a3ac4fe9438bcbea26f0c0b1d56869af851cff921f2db8f3adea713e", "ja": "お疲れ様、美奈子。\nフィッティングは大丈夫そうかな？", "zh": "辛苦了，美奈子。\n试装还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "f5514ba72fa8b7304dccdec285042a315a8690fc2c0ef5b92fe76fb2f8cb50bc", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　そうですね、私の方は……\n{$P$}さんから見て、どうですか？", "zh": "辛苦了！嗯，我这边嘛……从{$P$}先生来看，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1003_p", "source_sha256": "028967e3a30cff2398033dd853addc99ccb54e2e4f2a6a26fc8300673d0e00b6", "ja": "うん……バッチリだと思うよ。役としての\nカッコよさが際立ってるし、美奈子によく似合ってる。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得非常棒哦。不仅凸显出了角色的\n帅气之处，而且也很适合美奈子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "a60d6a6097e9bb8ebbbcc8629fff470850003a5a9992b758db8b0600c56f35bd", "ja": "わっほ～い！　ありがとうございます！\nそう言ってもらえて、ホッとしました♪", "zh": "哇哦～！谢谢你！\n能听到你这么说，我就放心了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "01d7ae2a5048c7d30f9acd1eff706223c2363eb3cffdfcfe0b1a9ceaa399c17a", "ja": "実は着替えてから、色々考えちゃってて……\nでも、おかげで安心です。えへへ♪", "zh": "其实换好衣服之后，我就胡思乱想了好多……\n不过，托您的福，我安心了。诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b159fec2663f08103ec384810b2d68e4256be4705b105f2d3a86d0bdf36fbc28", "ja": "色々？　そう言えば、\n何かあったか？", "zh": "各种事？这么说来，遇到什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "be9da8edd827eb3c9d9f902e2600851cfc36fe4cc5d60504c6c913279fb5b41c", "ja": "あ、問題があったとかではなくて！\n少しだけ、衣装に重みを感じていたって言うか……。", "zh": "啊，不是说出了什么问题！只是觉得这套服装稍微有些沉重……算是这么回事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "4bcea254d4cae8c3e2bd8087b91b84a45eb1ce0a5cb72e0c3bb81740044488d9", "ja": "役とは言え、艦長ですから。責任とか、覚悟とか、\nそういうのを背負っている人の服だなぁって。", "zh": "虽然只是在演戏，但毕竟是舰长嘛。所以就觉得，\n这身衣服承载了责任与觉悟……之类的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d435d3439e4b62782ff37a9466362acf819f7e69755a8b2cb9ef37bdc1ca868a", "ja": "なるほど、そういう重みか……。確かに、\n厳めしいというか、存在感のあるデザインだよな。", "zh": "原来如此，是那种分量啊……确实，这设计与其说是威严，不如说很有存在感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "fcf876f7757a011a38e94d6918a726cbd0e3cfd8271231e03159f3642139d234", "ja": "はい。それに個人的にも、続編っていうのに\n少しだけ意識する部分があって。", "zh": "是的。而且对我个人来说，续作这件事也有些在意的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "acf617f37c1ff599039ce1222b879b237ec2bea568f8a0409b6e370fc028abdf", "ja": "そういう色々が、プレッシャーみたいに\nなっているのかな～って思ったんです。", "zh": "我想，会不会是这些方方面面的事情，渐渐变成压力了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7847b90ecb0dc63213301a28c4d0abe7fe656abe004599752ec52c88919b6f9d", "ja": "大丈夫か？　プレッシャーを感じすぎても、\nそれはそれでよくないと思うけど。", "zh": "没事吧？要是压力太大，\n那反而也不太好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "3f61155d49ef5dcdfab75a44bcb60dd28b3bedd7b4f8f3e8e458fd469be00c4b", "ja": "私も、いつもはそう思うんですけど。でも今回は、\nプレッシャーを感じてたほうがいいのかも？って。", "zh": "我平时也总是这么想。不过这次，也许还是感受到压力比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "ae0999debc67a6a83b78d1ffe2dc178ad3200447461c5d028eb4c07eea1ee3b8", "ja": "艦長としての、責任を感じるっていうか……\n本当は、もっともっと大変なんでしょうけど。", "zh": "该说是感受到了作为舰长的责任吧……其实应该会更加辛苦才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1015_p", "source_sha256": "13ed32b21ed8cbd26e8c00c17d83c1c1eba0c170891ce6f209d2c304490c6709", "ja": "そうか……頼もしいな。\n美奈子本人がそう言うなら、大丈夫そうだな！", "zh": "这样啊……真可靠。\n既然美奈子本人都这么说了，应该没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_019min0594_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_019min0594_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "d9bb3497d62888b78548b4f939fa7de46000315f606cf88dfcefde9b8be447e0", "ja": "はい！　っていうか……頼もしいのは私じゃなくて、\n{$P$}さんの方ですよ？", "zh": "是！不过话说回来……真正可靠的不是我，而是{$P$}先生吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
